# Directory Structure

```
components/
├── ui/                    # Base shadcn components
│   ├── button.tsx
│   ├── table.tsx
│   ├── dialog.tsx
│   └── ...
│
├── table/
├── form/
├── dashboard/
├── data-display/
└── [CustomComponent].tsx

app/
└── styleguide/
    └── components/
        └── [component-name]/
            └── page.tsx
```

---

# Output

The final deliverable must include:

- Production-ready component
- Fully integrated with the CRM V4 Design System
- Matches the provided screenshots/Figma
- Uses shadcn only as infrastructure
- Uses semantic design tokens
- Added to the Styleguide
- Fully documented
- Accessible
- Responsive
- Dark mode compatible

---

# Important Principles

✔ Figma is the visual source of truth.

✔ Screenshots define the UI.

✔ The Markdown documentation defines functionality.

✔ The Design System defines tokens.

✔ shadcn/ui provides only the implementation foundation.

Never allow the default shadcn appearance to override the provided design.